  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Moving forward corresponds to either the user's view direction or the direction of the VR-controller. In the first case, the avatar moves forward in the direction the player is looking. In the second case, the avatar moves forward in the direction the VR-controller is pointing. The advantage of the second method is that moving forward, the player can look around, turning his head to the left and right. When I played «Half Life: Alyx», I chose the second method.",
